Subject: [PATCH 3/8] feat: let staff create percentage-off discount codes

Adds the discount_codes table (migration 008), DiscountCode, and
DiscountCodeService.create_percent_code, which validates the code and
records discount_code.created in the audit log. Not exposed over the API
yet.

